          "sentences": [
            {
              "speaker": "Ritika Oberoi",
              "start_time": 4.2,
              "text": "Hi Arjun, thanks for hopping on. So last time we spoke you were comparing term life plans for your family, right?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Arjun Malhotra",
              "start_time": 12.8,
              "text": "Yeah, mainly for my wife and me, we've got a 2 year old now so it's become urgent."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Ritika Oberoi",
              "start_time": 45.1,
              "text": "Makes sense. Based on what you told me, I'd suggest the 1 crore term plan with critical illness rider, comes to around 14,000 a year."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Arjun Malhotra",
              "start_time": 61.3,
              "text": "That's a bit steep for us right now honestly. Can we look at something closer to 9 or 10k?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Ritika Oberoi",
              "start_time": 70,
              "text": "Totally understand, the premium is the main concern. I can drop the rider and bring it to around 9,500, want me to send both quotes?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Arjun Malhotra",
              "start_time": 88.4,
              "text": "Yeah send both, I want to talk to my wife before deciding anything."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Ritika Oberoi",
              "start_time": 95.7,
              "text": "No problem. I'll email both quotes today. Can we plan a follow-up call next Tuesday to finalize?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Arjun Malhotra",
              "start_time": 104.2,
              "text": "Tuesday afternoon works, let's say 4 pm."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Ritika Oberoi",
              "start_time": 108.9,
              "text": "Perfect, I'll block 4 pm Tuesday and send the quotes in the next hour."
            }
          ],
